From: PES1UG24AM373 <pes1ug24am373@stu.pes.edu>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:55:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] fix(bandit): remove shell call and swallowed exception

- B605 (High): replace os.system("cat " + file) with reading the file in
  Python, so no shell is started and the filename can't inject commands.
- B110 (Low): cancel_reservation no longer uses try/except/pass; a missing
  reservation is reported instead of silently ignored.
- Close log file handles with `with` so output is flushed before it is read.
- Drop the now-unused `import os`.
